{"id":"655770","name":"排骨咸菜焖饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/655770/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"咸菜","amount":"30g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"4瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨用盐和淀粉抓洗干净。","img":"images/655770/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"客家咸菜、蒜瓣。","img":"images/655770/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把所有调料和蒜末放入排骨内。","img":"images/655770/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞拌均匀，先腌制入味20分钟。","img":"images/655770/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"咸菜切成碎粒。","img":"images/655770/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"不放油，开小火，把咸菜炒出香气。","img":"images/655770/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后再加上油，这样炒的咸菜更香。","img":"images/655770/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大米淘洗干净（一人量）。","img":"images/655770/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"舀入适量的咸菜。","img":"images/655770/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再放上排骨，一个人吃只放了几块。","img":"images/655770/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加上适量的清水，放入电饭锅焖煮。","img":"images/655770/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到，太香了！","img":"images/655770/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。家财万贯，不如咸菜下饭。","img":"images/655770/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}